      "title": "Request query passed to eval",
      "description": "The /calc handler passes req.query.expr straight to eval. Any caller controls the JavaScript that the server runs. An unauthenticated caller can run arbitrary code on the server, for example through require child_process. The added suppression comments hide this from linting. Remove eval and parse the expression with a restricted arithmetic evaluator such as expr-eval. Delete the two suppression comments.",
